    <grid>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "name": "1 column layout",
  "sections": [
    {
      "grid": "12",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "309e2d4b-2d7d-4f87-ba89-b73f65ff57bf",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p><em>From mines and quarries to windfarms and solar parks, our presence in the NC remains strong.</em></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 1914,
                    "udi": "umb://media/09710fb2b7b74a928bde35b69ebed152",
                    "image": "/media/wqhhccnx/1920-northern-cape-mining.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">The Northern Cape is home to 75% of the world's manganese deposits.</p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Along with some impressive iron ore and diamond operations, mining and quarrying contributes 18% to the local economy. That's more than double the national average of 7%.</p>\n<p>Over the past 5 years the various mining companies which operate in the Northern Cape have invested more than R700m in development projects.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Here are some of the award-winning projects we've been a part of in the Northern Cape .</strong></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 1916,
                    "udi": "umb://media/04d77a824ec942af9916827a6db6fa0f",
                    "image": "/media/qr3nobgj/kaxu-solar-one-project.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p>Roadlab's Upington branch conducted geotechnical investigations for Kaxu Solar One in 2015, ensuring the load-bearing capacity of the soil. This also allowed the engineers to evaluate and assure the integrity of the concrete bases on which all the individual panels would rest. </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}]]></Value>
